WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.800
A human edit.
好，我们开始。

2
00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:08.200
The cache hierarchy.
缓存层次结构。

3
01:15:12.345 --> 01:15:13.345
A -> B at minute 75.
A -> B，在第 75 分钟。

4
01:15:20.000 --> 01:15:26.000
Untranslated.
（未翻译）

5
01:15:26.000 --> 01:15:29.486
So when the processor misses
所以当处理器在一级缓存中未命中时，

6
01:15:29.486 --> 01:15:32.612
in the first level cache,
所以当处理器在一级缓存中未命中时，

7
01:15:32.612 --> 01:15:35.737
it asks the second level,
它会访问二级缓存；

8
01:15:35.737 --> 01:15:40.065
and only if that misses too does it
只有二级缓存也未命中，

9
01:15:40.065 --> 01:15:44.273
go all the way out to main memory,
才会一路访问主存，

10
01:15:44.273 --> 01:15:48.000
which costs hundreds of cycles.
这要花费数百个周期。

